# npm omits devDependencies by default when NODE_ENV=production (documented
# behavior of the `omit` config). Railway's Nixpacks build sets NODE_ENV=production
# during `npm ci`/`npm install`, which silently drops devDependencies needed for
# the build itself (e.g. @types/node, typescript) and breaks `next build`.
# Force nothing to be omitted, regardless of NODE_ENV.
omit=
